   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "M9 Wearable Breast Pump | Dial It In, Level By Level | 12 Minutes Charges A Session | It Buzzes Before It's Full | Under 48 dB At -300 mmHg | Lose The Tubes, Keep Power | Our Strongest Motor Yet | All 4 Flange Sizes Included | Set Your Own Rhythm | Up to -300mmHg Suction | Fridge-Ready Milk Bowl | FSA & HSA Eligible | Wearable, Still -300 mmHg | Insurance Options Available | Free 1-On-1 IBCLC Session | At 48dB it stays quiet through meetings. Overflow alerts keep sessions mess-free. | FSA/HSA eligible, 30-day risk-free returns and a 1-year warranty. | Cordless and wearable, with a 3rd-gen motor that still reaches -300 mmHg. | Comes with 17, 19, 21 and 24mm flanges — no ordering the right size separately.",
